" [1] My Issues │ [2] Team Issues │ [3] Analytics                                "
"┌My Issues─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│No open issues ┌ Keys ────────────────────────────────────────┐               │"
"│               │  a       Change the assignee                 │               │"
"│               │  p       Change the priority                 │               │"
"│               │  L       Add or remove labels                │               │"
"│               │  e       Change the estimate                 │               │"
"│               │  c       Comment in $EDITOR                  │               │"
"│               │          Create an issue                     │               │"
"│               │  Esc     Close the top overlay or step back  │               │"
"│               │                                              │               │"
"│               │Everywhere                                    │               │"
"│               │  1       Show My Issues                      │               │"
"│               │  2       Show Team Issues                    │               │"
"│               │  3       Show Analytics                      │               │"
"│               │  r       Refresh now                         │               │"
"│               │  ?, F1   Show every key for this context     │               │"
"│               │  :, C-k  Find an action or loaded issue      │               │"
"│               │  /       Search all issues in Linear         │               │"
"│               │  Q       Quit lrat                           │               │"
"│               └ Esc close ───────────────────────────────────┘               │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
" Move │ j/k move                                                                "
" Do   │ Esc close                                                               "
